      "updated": 1792912921967,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Part-I shows how a merchant's staff can ask about orders, retrieve order details, or request a refund\nthrough a simple AI-assisted backend, without using the Agents.\n\nThink of ShopHub as an online shopping platform where multiple merchants sell products.\nMerchant-A and Merchant-B use the same application, but each merchant must access only their own orders.\n \n",
      "fontSize": 19.655036379624036,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Part-I shows how a merchant's staff can ask about orders, retrieve order details, or request a refund\nthrough a simple AI-assisted backend, without using the Agents.\n\nThink of ShopHub as an online shopping platform where multiple merchants sell products.\nMerchant-A and Merchant-B use the same application, but each merchant must access only their own orders.\n \n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b5T"
